{"id":"vod_bf_31201","vodId":"31201","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"食梦者第二季","name_cn":"食梦者第二季","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-32/579f6a442432f99cda7e4f93bbc35768.jpg"},"summary":"《食梦者》是大场鸫和小畑健继《死亡笔记》之后再度合作的作品。主人公真诚是一名初三的学生，和大多数人一样对未来并没有什么打算，只想顺其自然的生活，他有着绘画的才能同时暗恋着同班的亚豆。就在一天下课后，他发现自己画有亚豆肖像的笔记本忘在学校了，为了防止被别人发现这个秘密，他急速的跑回了学校。而他的笔记本已经被一个人拿在了手里，那个人是高木。高木对想要拿回笔记本的真诚提出了一个条件：我来写剧本，你来绘画，让我们一起成为漫画家吧。为梦想，两人踏上成为漫画家的道路。本作为2011年秋番档期播放的第二季。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 07:58:42","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shimengzhedierji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shimengzhedierji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shimengzhedierji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shimengzhedierji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shimengzhedierji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shimengzhedierji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shimengzhedierji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shimengzhedierji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shimengzhedierji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shimengzhedierji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shimengzhedierji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shimengzhedierji/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shimengzhedierji/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shimengzhedierji/第14集/ind